OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and a few sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Chance of a few light showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping across the south, more
OL,9,Fespecially this afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few clear spells across the
OL,12,Fnorthwest. Otherwise it will be a
OL,13,Fmainly cloudy evening and night with
OL,14,Fone or two light showers. Light
OL,15,Feasterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA rather cloudy day with a few
OL,18,Flight showers, but many places will
OL,19,Fremain dry. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
