OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith a chance of showers on Saturday.
OL,7,FThen becoming dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud. Overnight low cloud
OL,9,Fand fog.
